        {
          "id": "data-storage-26-80",
          "start_line": 26,
          "end_line": 80,
          "source_heading": "这篇文章是 Easy-Vibe 教程中「数据模型全景：文档/图/时序/向量」章节，核心回答「为什么不能把所有数据都塞进 MySQL 表格」，系统介绍了文档、图、时序、向量四种数据模型的特点、适用场景和选型方法。以下是完整总结。",
          "destination": "draft/prerequisites/storage-models-and-indexes.md",
          "destination_heading": "文档、图、时序与向量模型",
          "action": "relocate-verbatim",
          "reason": "Group the approved source section under its chapter without rewriting or deduplicating.",
          "size": 6822,
          "sha256": "c05d0f4f504bb3f3a551e306bfe4435c4ca5c9ee7013e631cd03386dd09bb352",
          "start_marker": "<!-- source-block:data-storage-26-80:start -->",
          "end_marker": "<!-- source-block:data-storage-26-80:end -->"
        },
        {
          "id": "data-storage-81-93",
          "start_line": 81,
          "end_line": 93,
          "source_heading": "数据持久层（上）：理论分析\"，聚焦持久层中的存储技术选型理论：先讲关系数据库的三大范式（1NF/2NF/3NF）及权衡，再讲 NoSQL 出现的背景与四大分类（键值、列式、文档、对象），最后从\"Scale Up 到 Scale Out\"和\"结构化到非结构化\"两个角度总结存储技术演进趋势，为下一讲的实战案例做理论铺垫。",
          "destination": "draft/prerequisites/database.md",
          "destination_heading": "关系数据库与范式设计",
          "action": "relocate-verbatim",
